 ${misc:Depends},
Recommends:
 iio-sensor-proxy,
Description: Lenovo Yoga Book YB1-X91L sensor integration
 Identifies the display and base accelerometers exposed by both Yoga Book
 sensor hubs, supplies their mount matrices for desktop automatic rotation,
 and provides the SX9310 proximity threshold required by iio-sensor-proxy.
 .
 This package contains only udev and hardware-database sensor policy. It does
 not contain keyboard, pen, audio, firmware, or kernel components.
